<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- UMW_ZeusHeaded, UMW_PlasmaCored, UMW_Monomolecular, UMW_EltexPlated,
       UMW_EltexFitted and UMW_LeadLined are declared in this
       Royalty compat load root (1.6/Mods/Royalty/Defs/WeaponTraitDefs/) and carry
       no MayRequire of their own. MayRequire is honored on defs but
       IGNORED on DefInjected entries, so these injections live in this
       LoadFolders-gated compat root (1.6/Mods/Royalty loads only when Royalty is
       active) rather than the main
       1.6/Languages/French/DefInjected/WeaponTraitDef/WeaponTraits.xml, which would
       error on startup for players without Royalty. Style conventions for these
       entries are documented in that file's header comment. -->

  <!-- EN: monomolecular -->
  <UMW_Monomolecular.label>mono-moléculaire</UMW_Monomolecular.label>

  <!-- EN: The edge is honed to a single molecule and held there by a lattice of mechanites. It parts armor and bone as though they were not there. -->
  <UMW_Monomolecular.description>Le fil est affûté jusqu'à l'épaisseur d'une seule molécule et maintenu ainsi par un réseau de mécanites. Il sépare l'armure et l'os comme s'ils n'étaient pas là.</UMW_Monomolecular.description>

  <!-- EN: mono-edged -->
  <UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.0>à fil mono-moléculaire</UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: crystalline -->
  <UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.1>de cristal</UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: honed -->
  <UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.2>au fil poli</UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: plasma-cored -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.label>à cœur de plasma</UMW_PlasmaCored.label>

  <!-- EN: The core of the blade channels a sheath of plasma, held in place by an energy field and released into the wounds it cuts. It sears flesh and sometimes ignites the target. -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.description>Le cœur de la lame canalise une gaine de plasma, maintenue en place par un champ d'énergie et libérée dans chaque plaie qu'elle ouvre. Elle brûle la chair et enflamme parfois la cible.</UMW_PlasmaCored.description>

  <!-- EN: plasma-cored -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.0>à cœur de plasma</UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: burning -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.1>de flamme vive</UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: searing -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.2>de chaleur mordante</UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: fiery -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.3>de feu</UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.3>

  <!-- EN: incandescent -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.4>d'incandescence</UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.4>


  <!-- EN: zeus-headed -->
  <UMW_ZeusHeaded.label>tête de Zeus</UMW_ZeusHeaded.label>

  <!-- EN: The head houses a miniaturized zeus-cell that releases an electromagnetic discharge on impact, temporarily disabling electronics and mechanoids. -->
  <UMW_ZeusHeaded.description>La tête abrite une cellule de Zeus miniaturisée qui libère une décharge électromagnétique à l'impact et neutralise temporairement l'électronique et les mécanoïdes.</UMW_ZeusHeaded.description>

  <!-- EN: zeus-headed -->
  <UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.0>à tête de Zeus</UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: thunderous -->
  <UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.1>de tonnerre</UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: electric -->
  <UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.2>à décharge électrique</UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: shocking -->
  <UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.3>de décharge</UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: eltex-plated -->
  <UMW_EltexPlated.label>à placage d'eltex</UMW_EltexPlated.label>

  <!-- EN: The body is plated in pale eltex. The psychic focusing material enhances the wielder's psychic sensitivity and helps dissipate neural heat. -->
  <UMW_EltexPlated.description>Le corps est plaqué d'eltex pâle. Ce matériau de concentration psychique améliore la sensibilité psychique de l'utilisateur et aide à dissiper l'échauffement neuronal.</UMW_EltexPlated.description>

  <!-- EN: eltex-plated -->
  <UMW_EltexPlated.traitAdjectives.0>à placage d'eltex</UMW_EltexPlated.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: pale-sheened -->
  <UMW_EltexPlated.traitAdjectives.1>à éclat pâle</UMW_EltexPlated.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: resonant -->
  <UMW_EltexPlated.traitAdjectives.2>de résonance</UMW_EltexPlated.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: eltex-fitted -->
  <UMW_EltexFitted.label>à garnitures d'eltex</UMW_EltexFitted.label>

  <!-- EN: The grip and fittings are made of dark, unpolished eltex. They enhance the wielder's psychic sensitivity and increase their neural heat limit. -->
  <UMW_EltexFitted.description>La poignée et les garnitures sont en eltex sombre et non poli. Elles améliorent la sensibilité psychique de l'utilisateur et augmentent sa limite d'échauffement neuronal.</UMW_EltexFitted.description>

  <!-- EN: eltex-fitted -->
  <UMW_EltexFitted.traitAdjectives.0>à garnitures d'eltex</UMW_EltexFitted.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: eltex-furnished -->
  <UMW_EltexFitted.traitAdjectives.1>à montures d'eltex</UMW_EltexFitted.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: resonant -->
  <UMW_EltexFitted.traitAdjectives.2>de résonance</UMW_EltexFitted.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: lead-lined -->
  <UMW_LeadLined.label>à doublure de plomb</UMW_LeadLined.label>

  <!-- EN: The grip is lined with lead, which suppresses the wielder's psychic sensitivity. The extra weight slows the swing. -->
  <UMW_LeadLined.description>La poignée est doublée de plomb, qui supprime la sensibilité psychique de l'utilisateur. Le poids supplémentaire ralentit le coup.</UMW_LeadLined.description>

  <!-- EN: lead-lined -->
  <UMW_LeadLined.traitAdjectives.0>à doublure de plomb</UMW_LeadLined.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: leaden -->
  <UMW_LeadLined.traitAdjectives.1>de plomb</UMW_LeadLined.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: deadened -->
  <UMW_LeadLined.traitAdjectives.2>d'étouffement</UMW_LeadLined.traitAdjectives.2>

</LanguageData>
